    "field_description": [
        {
            "value": "Run the same decoupled frontend twice with two consumer IDs and get two differently branded sites. Decoupled Settings serves the site and theme config Drupal already holds over JSON:API, with per-consumer overrides. Four years ago I guessed the answer would be Consumers plus theme settings. Turns out it was."
        }
    ],
